---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1)
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="construye-hero">
  <div class="hero-bg-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow orb-amber" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow orb-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container hero-container">
    <!-- Institutional Origin Banner -->
    <div class="origin-banner">
      <div class="origin-logos">
        <!-- Dr. Frank Betances Emblem -->
        <div class="logo-item emblem-wrapper" title="Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso">
          <img 
            src={`${baseUrl}/assets/descubre-con-lua/dr-betances-emblem.jpg`} 
            alt="Emblema del Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso" 
            class="emblem-img" 
            loading="eager" 
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="origin-separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <!-- startTIC Logo -->
        <div class="logo-item partner-pill" title="Incubadora de Alta Tecnología startTIC">
          <img 
            src={`${baseUrl}/assets/descubre-con-lua/startic-logo.png`} 
            alt="Incubadora de Alta Tecnología startTIC" 
            class="partner-img startic-img" 
            loading="eager" 
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="origin-separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <!-- Consorcio da Zona Franca de Vigo Logo -->
        <div class="logo-item partner-pill" title="Consorcio de la Zona Franca de Vigo">
          <img 
            src={`${baseUrl}/assets/descubre-con-lua/zona-franca-vigo-logo.png`} 
            alt="Consorcio de la Zona Franca de Vigo" 
            class="partner-img zona-franca-img" 
            loading="eager" 
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="origin-text">
        <strong>Dr. Frank Alberto Betances Reinoso</strong> · Incubadora de Alta Tecnología <strong>startTIC</strong> · <strong>Consorcio Zona Franca de Vigo</strong> · <strong>Earlify Health</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Badges -->
    <div class="hero-badges">
      <span class="hero-badge badge-orange">
        <span class="badge-dot dot-orange"></span>
        Educación Infantil y Estimulación (0 a 6 años)
      </span>
      <span class="hero-badge badge-emerald">
        <span class="badge-dot dot-emerald"></span>
        100% Manipulativo · Cero Pantallas para el Menor
      </span>
      <span class="hero-badge badge-cyan">
        <span class="badge-dot dot-cyan"></span>
        Seguridad Europea EN 71-1
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline -->
    <div class="hero-title-area">
      <div class="lua-avatar-badge">
        <img 
          src={`${baseUrl}/assets/valeria_lua.png`} 
          alt="Lúa, la mascota guía de aprendizaje tangible" 
          class="lua-hero-avatar"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Lúa Construye <br />
        <span class="gradient-text-brick">Aprender con las Manos, Escuchar con el Corazón</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Lead Narrative -->
    <p class="hero-lead">
      El sistema de juego tangible y estimulación neurofuncional diseñado para escuelas infantiles, gabinetes clínicos y familias. Mientras las niñas y niños construyen caminos, exploran texturas y resuelven retos reales sobre la alfombra, la persona adulta dispone de una guía pedagógica y acústica paso a paso <strong>sin exponer a la infancia a las pantallas</strong>.
    </p>

    <!-- Primary CTAs focused on lead generation -->
    <div class="hero-cta-group">
      <button 
        id="open-contact-modal-hero" 
        class="btn-primary-hero"
        onclick="document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.classList.add('open'); document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');"
      >
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
          <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Solicitar Información o Demostración</span>
      </button>

      <a href="#como-funciona" class="btn-secondary-hero">
        <span>Descubrir la Metodología</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <a href="#lineas-aplicacion" class="btn-tertiary-hero">
        <span>Ver Aplicaciones en Aula y Clínica</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Value Proposition Highlights -->
    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-icon-pill pill-orange">👐</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Juego 100% Tangible</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Desarrollo de la motricidad bimanual, la orientación espacial y la lógica secuencial mediante bloques físicos reales.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-icon-pill pill-emerald">🛡️</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Ergonomía y Seguridad</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Piezas de gran formato adaptadas al agarre palmar infantil bajo los estándares europeos de seguridad pediátrica (EN 71-1).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-icon-pill pill-cyan">🎧</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Guía Acústica para el Adulto</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Locuciones naturales, canciones a compás visual e iniciación al inglés por movimiento para acompañar sin esfuerzo.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-icon-pill pill-purple">🏫</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Doble Vertiente: Aula y Clínica</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Conectado con <strong>Descubre con Lúa</strong> para escuelas infantiles y con <strong>Valeria+</strong> para estimulación del lenguaje.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .construye-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);
    background-size: 32px 32px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 75%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -2;
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(90px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .orb-amber {
    top: -100px;
    left: 18%;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.16) 0%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0) 70%);
  }

  .orb-cyan {
    top: 20%;
    right: 12%;
    width: 450px;
    height: 450px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12) 0%, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0) 70%);
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Origin Banner */
  .origin-banner {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .origin-logos {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .emblem-wrapper .emblem-img {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid #FB923C;
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.4);
  }

  .partner-pill {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .partner-img {
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .startic-img {
    height: 30px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .zona-franca-img {
    height: 34px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .origin-separator {
    width: 1px;
    height: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .origin-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .origin-text strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* Badges */
  .hero-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .badge-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12);
    color: #FDBA74;
    border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
  }
  .dot-orange { background: #FB923C; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #FB923C; }

  .badge-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    color: #67E8F9;
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
  }
  .dot-cyan { background: #00F2FE; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00F2FE; }

  .badge-emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    color: #6EE7B7;
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }
  .dot-emerald { background: #10B981; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10B981; }

  /* Title Area */
  .hero-title-area {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lua-avatar-badge {
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FB923C, #00F2FE);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
  }

  .lua-hero-avatar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: #07090e;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .gradient-text-brick {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FB923C 0%, #F97316 45%, #00F2FE 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    max-width: 840px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-lead strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* CTAs */
  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary-hero,
  .btn-secondary-hero,
  .btn-tertiary-hero {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .btn-primary-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F97316 0%, #EA580C 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 22px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-primary-hero:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.55);
  }

  .btn-secondary-hero {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
    color: #67E8F9;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
  }

  .btn-secondary-hero:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    border-color: #00F2FE;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-tertiary-hero {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .btn-tertiary-hero:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* KPI Grid */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1140px;
  }

  .kpi-card {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.35rem;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .kpi-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -6px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
  }

  .kpi-icon-pill {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pill-orange { background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3); }
  .pill-emerald { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); }
  .pill-cyan { background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3); }
  .pill-purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); }

  .kpi-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .kpi-desc {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .kpi-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .kpi-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .kpi-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .hero-badges {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .hero-cta-group {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-primary-hero,
    .btn-secondary-hero,
    .btn-tertiary-hero {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
